OL,3,AIsraeli exit polls suggest no clear
OL,4,Awinner in pivotal general election
OL,5,
OL,6,FWith just over half the votes counted,
OL,7,FIsrael's election result is far from
OL,8,Fcertain with neither of the two main
OL,9,Fblocs on track to reach a majority in
OL,10,Fthe Knesset
OL,12,FEisenkot leads the newly formed Yashar
OL,13,Fparty and is the main figure in the
OL,14,F"change bloc", a group of opposition
OL,15,Fparties with the shared goal of ousting
OL,16,FNetanyahu
OL,18,FExit polls also suggest Netanyahu's
OL,19,FLikud party is set to be the biggest
OL,20,Fsingle party in the Israeli parliament
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
