OL,3,AIsraeli exit polls suggest no clear
OL,4,Awinner in pivotal general election
OL,5,
OL,6,FNetanyahu says a "strong" right-wing
OL,7,Fgovernment must be formed, while
OL,8,FEisenkot tells supporters that Israel
OL,9,Fvoted to end Netanyahu's term
OL,11,FOfficial results started being released
OL,12,Ffrom midnight local time (22:00 GMT),
OL,13,Fbut counting could take days
OL,15,FAll 120 seats in the Knesset, Israel's
OL,16,Fparliament, are up for grabs, but no
OL,17,Fparty has ever won a majority and in
OL,18,Fthe past governments have been made up
OL,19,Fof coalitions
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
